  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "76ab3245-da33-4f5e-90b4-5b06f608013b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Heavyside Shear in $x$\n",
    "This one is given by $y = (\\operatorname{sign}(x-x_0),0)$, then $u \\in L^\\infty\\backslash W^{1,\\infty}$, and we have that $\\nabla \\cdot u = 0$ and $u = \\nabla |x-x_0|$ so that Kings Theorem Apply"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 87,
   "id": "a9cafcdc-c59e-4d3b-adcd-934b3ea63be1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def wind_func(mesh):\n",
    "    x,y = SpatialCoordinate(mesh)\n",
    "    x0 = Constant(np.pi / 2.0)\n",
    "    return as_vector([sign(x - x0), Constant(0.0)])"
   ]
  },
